setslot('en',99,226,'["Mars, mighty in arms, rules the fierce tasks of war; often he casts himself into your lap, bound by love’s eternal wound … Gazing longingly at you, goddess, he feeds his love-hungry eyes, and as he lies back, his breath hangs upon your mouth. As he reclines upon your sacred body, goddess, bend around him from above and pour sweet words from your mouth." — Lucretius, i. 32–40, excerpts in Montaigne’s wording.]')
